			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- **Door follow fix**: Broadened door detection with area scan fallback when raycast misses doors on diagonal paths\n- **Reduced door avoidance**: prefer-vertical-climb avoidance reduced from 10s to 3s to prevent distant rerouting\n- **Ladder over elytra**: Bot now prefers ladder/vine descent when a climbable column reaches the target Y level\n- **Elytra edge-running fix**: Bot walks off the edge at higher speed instead of hopping in place\n- **Package rename**: `shasankp000` → `wcfcarolina13`\n\n## Install\nDrop `frens-1.0.6-release+1.21.11.jar` into your Fabric mods folder (Minecraft 1.21.11).\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/commits/v1.0.6\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/wcfcarolina13/Frens/commits/v1.0.6"
		}
